{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-03_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-03","title":"通訊靜默解除","storyCode":"14-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e491760cbafa04b7cd9fef537c208e244a50c8405c0ad0da332c6d01084916e0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"高多汀公爵邀請推進之王為首的典範軍以議會名義行事，但推進之王並不信任高多汀公爵。可露希爾透過訊號發現戰場上竟然出現了食腐者的大部隊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，您、您是——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……哈……現在好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人啊，一旦上了點年紀，就會更傾向於待在明亮又暖和的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這股香氣……是豆子的味道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是、是的。我剛剛煮了點豆子，打算當晚飯，雖然只是些罐頭啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想來一點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不客氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……就是缺了點家鄉的調料。能再配點醃獸肉就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧！我也覺得，我們高多汀人都……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，這位小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。我就是覺得，您和新聞裡見到的不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你可以多和你的隊長打聽一下。她小時候可還被我抱過呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得當時的小麗塔對我說，我的角摸起來滑滑的，為什麼她的爸爸就沒有呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……公爵閣下，請原諒我的無禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敢碰我角的人可不太多，斯卡曼德羅斯中尉，你從很小的時候，就表現出了極為英勇的品質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該說……你們，在這裡的每一位，都是我們維多利亞最出色的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在切特雷鎮保衛戰中的表現著實令人讚嘆。之後在布倫特伍德也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“典範軍”……是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就想當面見一見各位英雄了。只可惜，你們的領導者似乎並不情願與我碰面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下，我想，任何人都很難把您突然出現在這裡的行為……視作善意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，溫德米爾小姐，我能夠理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是……在這種特殊時期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已派人去過“加拉瓦鐵盾”了。他們的行駛速度非常快，但好在我還來得及為安費莉絲獻上一束花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……感謝您的好意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下，您親自找上我們，大概不是為了給我們頒發獎章吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……我說是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請您說得更直白些。我們中的大部分都不是貴族，也沒受過什麼高等教育，不習慣話裡藏話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下，您果然和傳聞中一樣……颯爽直接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，我還是和您的同伴一樣，稱呼您為推進之王吧？您可能也會更舒適一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王小姐，其實我很理解，“典範軍”這一路上避讓公爵部隊的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不願意讓這支隊伍被公爵之間的利益紛爭裹挾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您希望……它能夠和當年那支傳奇隊伍一樣，僅為維多利亞和維多利亞人民而戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我來到這裡，也並不是以高多汀公爵的名義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，維多利亞議會成員肖恩·高多汀，向你們，議會直屬部隊風暴突擊隊——及其餘典範軍成員發起邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下那個過時的識別碼小盒吧，我希望你們以議會的名義，介入這場戰爭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"……礦工們的營地，已經完全燒毀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有發現薩卡茲士兵的蹤跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Misery感到微微有些冷。這些燃燒殆盡的營地幾乎沒有一點熱量。\n他撥開坍塌的木構，發現了幾具早已面目全非的屍體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"礦工。感染者的遺體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"……在哪裡都一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"“靈幛”，居然藏在地裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"吉布森鎮西北郊發現食腐者——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"……這就超過了通訊距離嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“靈幛”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"死亡，抓住你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"數把鐫刻著銘文的劍從Misery腳下的土地中猛然刺出，可Misery卻已不在他剛才的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"匕首割破空間，Misery已經退到了他們的攻擊範圍之外。傾頹的廢墟轉瞬間化為牢籠，鎖住了食腐者們乾枯的身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"別吵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"我也抓住你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……公爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據我所知，維多利亞議會很久沒有正常運轉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一個從倫蒂尼姆逃出去的人都知道，這段時間在聖王會西部大堂發號施令的，是薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我並不想否認現狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們也不妨把眼光放得更長遠一些，看看戰爭結束後的將來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，將來？想以此要脅，或者更好聽些，“交易”，是不是都太早了些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您誤會了。高多汀並非開斯特，比起談判，我更熱衷於圍在爐火旁，與朋友一同喝喝酒、打打牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，夏天一過，天氣就一下子冷起來了——介意讓我的人來添點柴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已經在門外了，就進來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……這樣舒服多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛說到哪了？對，“將來”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道，戰爭將要結束，而且獲勝者必須是維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這場戰爭無疑會……不，是已經對我們造成了不可逆轉的影響。僵持了二十多年的局面終於將迎來改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這間屋子裡有人對城裡的空王座感興趣，那個人一定不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，很好，您看，我們已經達成了至少一個共識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞您說，我不久前剛努力地張羅了一次小小的聚會，見了見那位鐵公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次見到他，我都會忍不住想起自己第一次見到“加斯特里爾”號的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和許多聽著“帝國喪鐘”傳說長大的孩子一樣，我努力尋找著屬於林貢斯的那片殘骸的影子……然後我發現，我並不能看到高盧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的，只有屬於這個時代最強盛的國家的光輝。它是那樣地璀璨，幾乎令我目眩神迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您試圖讓我們相信，比起高多汀領地的利益，您更在意……整個維多利亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如您是指某種“高尚”的愛國情懷，坦誠地說，我可沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為公爵，在任何語境下，都不得不優先考慮自己的領地。請相信我，這不僅是利益問題，也是一種責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想的是，高多汀與威靈頓有多大的不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒了維多利亞，威靈頓依然是威靈頓。可一旦這光輝黯淡或者熄滅，高多汀……又會變成什麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許不會太差，但一定不會更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不想看到各個大公爵真正地分裂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您會知道的……這樣想的絕不只我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強大的維多利亞並非沒有對手。烏薩斯，萊塔尼亞，哥倫比亞，甚至薩爾貢，所有懷有野心的國家都在盯著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這場戰爭之後，我們需要一個統一的聲音，來迅速地穩定局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是議會存在的意義。所有公爵領地……包括溫德米爾領，都會選出最合適的代言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是“典範軍”——你們這群戰爭英雄的意義。每一個願意為了維多利亞奮戰的士兵，都絕不會再度遭遇背叛和辜負。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角&風笛","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下，自維多利亞議會成立以來，議長始終都由國王本人擔任，但這並不意味著議長必須待在王座上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您願意，這也將是您能為我們所有人帶來的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人都沉默著。\n只有高多汀點起來的火在嗶剝作響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下，我只有一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然所有的這些話，您都可以在打完這場仗之後，再找我說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，假如我現在說“不”，我和我的同伴，可以帶著諸王之息轉身離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，外面有弩手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們被包圍了。或者說，早在他出現的時候，就已經……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……挺好，除了開斯特的“承諾”之外，我們還見識到了高多汀的“友誼”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友之間是平等的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的邀請，也依然公平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少……我也給了這位同鄉小朋友用破城矛指著我的機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第六號無人機又失去了訊號——唉唉，這環境真的太差了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白輪，小易，維克多，沒辦法了，還是得靠大家手動控制探測點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們各自情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"沒問題。信標已經打進去了，感測器開始運作。風沙的干擾還是有點強，我正在過濾雜訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"維克多，你也快一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":true,"text":"五分鐘。地面比預期的軟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"小心流沙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"術師幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":true,"text":"這一帶地質和之前採樣結果差距很大。這部分數據我也傳回去了，隊長，你收到了沒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了你啊，小易，我就知道把你挖過來是對的。咳咳……不枉我被地靈瞪了好幾天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":true,"text":"可露希爾小姐，你也得找一個好一些的作業環境，別吃進去太多沙子……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白輪，不要學阿米婭的語氣好不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的血可是有自我淨化功能的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別光笑我，快工作啊！越快搞定這個通訊塔，安全區的位置就能越早被廣播出去，你們也能早點去鎮上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在努力了啊！羅德島的設備這麼特殊，我的學習速度夠驚人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是認真的，你和洛洛根本就不該跟我留在這個位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機借給你了，我當然要和無人機在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，洛洛都這麼說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，你們是在操心我的安全……呃，一下打不死那些子裔也沒什麼丟人的吧？血魔和血魔之間的差距，本來就有那——麼大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你倆，最好找頭盔戴一下。變成感染者可不是什麼開玩笑的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，多謝關心。倒是你們……在戰場上跑來跑去也很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的大家啊。不顧自身安危，在這片戰場上四處奔波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，白輪先生是維多利亞出身的感染者，小易小姐是感染者但不是維多利亞人，維克多先生既不是感染者，也不是維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島幹員本來就哪裡來的都有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些天，我還是難以避免會想起奶奶，克洛維希婭，還有……湯米他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經希望，自救軍也能和我所見到的羅德島幹員一樣團結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，呃……很難說有誰是天生的好人或者壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"環境變了的話，人也會變，說不定有一天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，自救軍也能成為一個聯結緊密、行動統一的組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像如今向著同一個目標挺進的“典範軍”。我們能在災厄環境中一往無前，也準備好了直面失利乃至背叛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但團結我們的未必是相同的種族、出身或境遇……就像羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，別誇，知道你想留下我們的設備了。要不然合約簽一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，我並不羡慕羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不如說，你們給我的感覺，和你手中這個神奇的通訊設備差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一種可能性——讓我知道，自己並不是過於幼稚，對未來抱有癡心妄想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特，是不是你話太多了，影響可露希爾小姐工作……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看洛克十八傳回來的畫面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"監視器中，在充滿了噪點的圖像裡，煙塵正滾滾而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災？可是數據上……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"煙塵之下，是殘破的旌旗和戰爭的低語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者……怎麼會在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個，立刻離開這裡……還有其他自救軍成員，往吉布森鎮的方向撤，馬上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼動靜——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是薩卡茲！他們居然已經到這裡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迎擊！準備戰鬥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸聲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下，薩卡茲正在進攻這個小鎮，請您馬上和我們一起撤離！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我們暴露得比預想的快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲從安費莉絲那裡嘗到了甜頭啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來的是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是食腐者的精銳軍團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下，請帶著你的人和我們一起撤離，這個小鎮沒有防守的意義。但各位的存在，對維多利亞的未來卻相當重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請相信我們的高速戰艦，我們能在三個小時之內回到銀石崖前線，那裡才應該是你們發光發熱的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉著一把劍吸引所有的目光嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下，我們的時間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的時間很有限，你們不打算迎擊，哪怕你們知道這裡還有那麼多平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們當然會無視他們，哪怕搬出議會的名頭來，這些窮苦人家裡三輩子也出不了一個議員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的牌桌上沒有他們的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下，我只是更關注現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現實？現實就是，你理想中維多利亞的未來在那些掛滿了飾旗的大廳裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這些人，就是我的維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高級軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵閣下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，亞歷山德莉娜殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有時候和你的父親真像，天真，莽撞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？我不在乎，我已經不記得他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，祝你們好運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，我需要整個地塊上的戰鬥人員立刻集結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，通知希勒少尉，後勤和醫療隊待命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經通知了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人按計劃展開行動，保護平民，準備戰鬥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
